Reproduces hits 0.20 / justice 0.00 / dupe 0.15 / hid 0.3695 / came 0.40 on a
release binary from 0f36c2e and names the edit behind each one. Records the
measurement that decides the mechanism: over the 75-symbol corpus alphabet,
phonetics::distance has mean 0.7825 across distinct symbols and 93.8% of
pairs are dearer than GAP_COST, because the alphabet is a mixed ASCII/IPA
transliteration and the distance is over codepoints, not phonemes. k->U+0261
